 "text": " SEARCH\n MANAGE MY BOOKINGS\nLIST YOUR VENUE\n HOME\n LOGIN\n SIGN UP\n BECOME A VENUE PARTNER\n\nChoose a sport and search by location or venue\n\nSelect a sport\nFIND VENUE\n\nList your venue 🏫 Connect your sport facilities with your local communities! Learn more »\n\n Explore nearby venues\nPowerleague Enfield\nFootball\n Book Online at Powerleague Enfield\nSat 12 September - Fri 18 September\nMorning Afternoon\nSat\n12nd\nSun\n13rd\nMon\n14th\nTue\n15th\nWed\n16th\nThu\n17th\nFri\n18th\n17:00\nBooked\n60 min\n09:00\n£75.00\n60 min\n10:00\n£75.00\n60 min\n11:00\n£75.00\n60 min\n12:00\n£75.00\n60 min\n13:00\n£75.00\n60 min\n14:00\n£75.00\n60 min\n15:00\n£75.00\n60 min\n16:00\n£75.00\n60 min\n17:00\n£75.00\n60 min\n18:00\n£75.00\n60 min\n19:00\n£75.00\n60 min\n20:00\n£75.00\n60 min\n21:00\n£75.00\n60 min\n17:00\n£75.00\n60 min\n18:00\n£75.00\n60 min\n19:00\n£95.00\n60 min\n20:00\nBooked\n60 min\n21:00\n£75.00\n60 min\n17:00\n£75.00\n60 min\n18:00\n£75.00\n60 min\n19:00\nBooked\n60 min\n19:40\nBooked\n40 min\n20:00\n£95.00\n60 min\n20:20\nBooked\n40 min\n21:00\n£75.00\n60 min\n17:00\n£75.00\n60 min\n18:00\nBooked\n60 min\n19:00\nBooked\n60 min\n20:00\n£95.00\n60 min\n21:00\n£75.00\n60 min\n17:00\n£75.00\n60 min\n18:00\n£75.00\n60 min\n19:00\n£95.00\n60 min\n20:00\n£95.00\n60 min\n21:00\n£75.00\n60 min\n17:00\nBooked\n60 min\n18:00\nBooked\n60 min\n19:00\n£95.00\n60 min\n20:00\n£95.00\n60 min\n21:00\n£75.00\n60 min\nLocation, Opening Hours and Prices\n Click to interact with the map\n\n Edmonton County School, Great Cambridge Road, Enfield, EN1 1HQ\n\nPrices\n\nAround £64.50/hour\n\nPublic Transport\n\n Bush Hill Park (National Rail)\n\nOpening Hours\nMonday\t09:00 - 23:00\nTuesday\t09:00 - 23:00\nWednesday\t09:00 - 23:00\nThursday\t09:00 - 23:00\nFriday\t09:00 - 23:00\nSaturday\t09:00 - 23:00\nSunday\t09:00 - 23:00\nDescription\n\nLooking to hire a 5-a-side football pitch in north London? Powerleague Enfield is perfect for lovers of the small-sided version of the beautiful game. 5-a-side football at Powerleague Enfield is played on 3G astroturf. So whether you're looking for a casual kick about with your friends or whether you're part of a team that is a cohesive 5-a-side football machine, Powerleague Enfield is the right choice for you.\n\nThis facility is also brilliantly floodlit. Late night sessions are not a problem at this venue, which means the facility is perfect for those who love to play sport after work.\n\nThose driving are able to park free of charge at the facility. There are limited spaces available with weekends being particularly popular. The best parking availability is during the day and before 5pm.\n\nCustomers will be pleased to know that the venue operates a pay-as-you-play booking system. This means sports enthusiasts can just turn up and play depending on availability and book on a pay as you play basis. This method avoids the monthly membership charges and gives you the freedom to play as and when you like, without the commitment of a weekly game or a membership fee.\n\nFor those who like the security of knowing you can play at the same time every week without fail, you can make a block booking at Powerleague Enfield. This ensures you stay in the game and keep up your fitness on a regular basis. The very accommodating team at Playfinder will help you to secure your preferred slot or if that isn’t available, we will help you to secure the best alternative. A block booking is a booking made for a set number of consecutive weeks, on average this is 10 weeks.\n\nThe changing rooms on offer here are excellent. Well maintained and spacious changing rooms provide the perfect environment in which to prepare for your match. The venue's changing rooms provide toilets and also a communal changing area. The well-equipped changing rooms provide an additional excellence to this already outstanding sports facility. If you're looking to travel using public transport, then the nearest station is Bush Hill Park. This facility has excellent public transport links making it easy for all participants to reach the venue.\n\n Football Pitches\n5 a side | 3G Astroturf7 a side | 3G Astroturf\nFacilities\n floodlights changing rooms free parking\n Address\n\nPowerleague Enfield\nEdmonton County School\nGreat Cambridge Road\nEN1 1HQ\n\n\nVIEW ON MAP\nMAKE A BOOKING\n Nearby Football Pitches\nMallinson Sports Centre\nHighgate\n\n 5.7 miles away\n\nHenry Fawcett Primary School\nLondon\n\n 10.6 miles away\n\nHaberdasher's Crayford Academy\nKent\n\n 16.5 miles away\n\nHaberdasher's Crayford Academy\nKent\n\n 16.5 miles away\n\nHaberdasher's Crayford Academy\nKent\n\n 16.5 miles away\n\n",
